(h)
latrine and urinals;
(i)
spittoons;
(j)
fencing of machinery;
(k)
work at or near machinery in motion;
(l)
employment of adolescent on dangerous machines;
(m)
instructions, training and supervision in relation to employment of adolescent on dangerous machines;
(n)
device for cutting off power;
(o)
self-acting machiners;
(p)
easing of new machinery;
(q)
floor, stairs and means of access;
(r)
pits, sumps, openings in floors, etc.;
(s)
excessive weights;
(t)
protection of eyes;
(u)
explosive or inflammable dust, gas, etc.;
(v)
precautions in case of fire;
(w)
maintenance of buildings; and
(x)
safety of buildings and machinery.
